<p class="para lt-chem-349446"><strong class="emphasis bold">Formal charge on an atom</strong></p>

<p class="para lt-chem-349446"><a href="https://chem.libretexts.org/Courses/Howard_University/General_Chemistry%3A_An_Atoms_First_Approach/Unit_2%3A__Molecular_Structure/Chapter_5%3A_Covalent_Bonding/Chapter_5.3%3A_Lewis_Structures#av_1.0-ch04_s05_s03_eq01" rel="internal">Equation </a>5.3.1: \( formal\; charge=valence\; e^{-}-\left ( non-bonding\; e^{-}+\frac{bonding\; e^{-}}{2} \right ) \)&#8203;</p>
